<td id="S6.T3.2.1.20.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="S6.T3.2.1.20.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-0.1pt;"><img src="2510.05444v1/icons/microsoft.png" id="S6.T3.g18" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:16/16;" width="16" height="16" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> Phi-3 Medium</td>
