<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Conversation statistics for user simulator methods and real human users in math tutoring and document creation tasks. <span id="A4.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">#Turns</span> and <span id="A4.T5.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Cost</span> are averaged per conversation, and <span id="A4.T5.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Message Length</span> per message. Even the most expensive user simulator method costs less than 3% of the human cost, and
prompt caching can further reduce it.</figcaption>
</figure>
