<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 10: </span>Evaluating whether the user simulator achieves similar end outcomes to real users. For math tutoring, we compare the correctness of the simulator’s answers with those from real users. For document creation, we measure the Spearman correlation between document ratings from simulated and real-user conversations.</figcaption>
</figure>
