<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:134.3pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.12.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:113.2pt;">
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.p12.1" class="ltx_p">User Turn 5: Could you change "coffee’s on me" to dinner’s on me"</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:134.3pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.2.14.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:113.2pt;">
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F23.p2.pic1.p14.1" class="ltx_p">User Turn 6: Could you add any other improvements to my note to make it seem really appreciative and make me seemed humbled by the experience</span>
</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
        
</div></div></div>
