<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">User Turn 2: I am writing a not to a colleague who filled in for me at work when needed. I would like the tone to be casual. I’d like the note to be under 200 words.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:134.3pt;"></span></span></span>
