<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">User Turn 3: Could you include a mention of how a very stressful personal event (storm damage to my house) was made easier by their help?</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:134.3pt;"><span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:134.3pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F25.p2.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:134.3pt;"></span></span></span>
