<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p36.1" class="ltx_p">Thought: [Your analysis of the current situation and how to express it according to the user profile]</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.37" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.37.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.38" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p38" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p38.1" class="ltx_p">Query: [Your initial query for the AI tutor]</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.39" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.39.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.39.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.40" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.40.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.40.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p40" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p40.1" class="ltx_p"># Notes:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.41" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.41.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p41" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p41.1" class="ltx_p">- The tutor already knows the problem, so you don’t need to restate it in your query.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.42" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.42.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p42" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p42.1" class="ltx_p">- Don’t ask about simple arithmetic or very basic steps that you can solve easily.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.43" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.43.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.43.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F39.pic1.2.44.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p44" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F39.pic1.p44.1" class="ltx_p">Stay in character as the specified student throughout your output, following the guidelines and user profile characteristics carefully.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
