<span id="A7.F46.pic1.p47" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F46.pic1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">1. Any feature focused on interaction style (e.g., "Query Length," "Detailedness," "Clarification Seeking," "Feedback Style," "Contextual Reference," etc.) must be excluded from the final streamlined list.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
