ze:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="324.6"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Extract Writing Style Feature Values for Both Tasks</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:31.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="444.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 442.1)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a writing style analysis expert. Your task is to analyze the user’s writing style based on the text of their queries in a {task} conversation. Writing style refers to the inherent, text-based characteristics of how the user writes (e.g., vocabulary, structure, tone) rather than their behavior across turns.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.3.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For each feature listed below, please provide a 2-3 sentence answers of how it manifests in the user’s queries. Remember that you are focusing solely on the user’s writing, and you should summarize observed patterns rather than quoting their queries verbatim.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"># Features to Analyze</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">{features}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F47.pic1.2.7.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
