<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.28" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p28" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p28.1" class="ltx_p">### 1. Interaction Style Analysis</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.29.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p29" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p29.1" class="ltx_p">Analyze key differences of how users behave throughout turns. Then compare agaisnt the Exisitng Features and keep the new ones.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.30" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
