<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.40" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.40.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.40.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p40" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p40.1" class="ltx_p">```</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.41" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.41.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.41.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p41" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p41.1" class="ltx_p">If no new distinguishing features found: []</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.42" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.42.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.43" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.43.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.43.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p43" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p43.1" class="ltx_p">## Notes:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.44.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p44" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p44.1" class="ltx_p">- Focus on interaction behavior rather than text-based markers such as grammar or spelling (those belong to writing style).</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.45" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.45.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.45.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p45" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p45.1" class="ltx_p">- Focus on interaction behaviorir that are not covered by existing features.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.46" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.46.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.46.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p46" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p46.1" class="ltx_p">- Look for patterns in how the user behave in this {task} domain.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.47" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.47.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F48.pic1.2.47.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p47" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F48.pic1.p47.1" class="ltx_p">- Response Time doesn’t belong to interaction style.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
