<span id="A7.F49.pic1.p43.1" class="ltx_p">## Important Note: Remove Writing-Related Features</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F49.pic1.2.44.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F49.pic1.p44" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F49.pic1.p44.1" class="ltx_p">Any feature focused on writing style (e.g., "Grammar Usage," "Vocabulary Level," "Sentence Structure," "Text Formatting," etc.) must be excluded from the final streamlined list.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
