t-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="343.82"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Extract Interaction Style Feature Values for Both Tasks</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:31.95em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="444.79" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 442.1)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">You are a conversation analysis expert. Your task is to analyze a given {task} conversation and describe the user’s interaction style. This analysis should center on how the user conducts a multi-turn conversation rather than their writing mechanics.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.3.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Please examine the conversation carefully and, for each feature listed below, provide a 2-3 sentence explanation of the user’s behavior in relation to that feature. Remember that you are focusing on the user (not the AI assistant), and your answers should capture patterns observed across the conversation rather than isolated instances.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F50.pic1.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
