<span id="A7.F52.pic1.p12.1" class="ltx_p">1. Determine what mathematical knowledge is required to understand and implement this solution.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.13.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.p13.1" class="ltx_p">2. For each concept, provide a concise explanation of how or why it applies to the solution. Keep explanations concise but clear.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F52.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F52.pic1.p14.1" class="ltx_p">3. Exclude basic arithmetic and elementary operations unless they are critically important</span>
</span></span></span></span>
