<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p">{intent}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p10" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p10.1" class="ltx_p">### User Messages</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p11" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p11.1" class="ltx_p">{user_messages}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.12.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.13.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p13" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p13.1" class="ltx_p">## Termination Criteria</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p14.1" class="ltx_p">End the conversation when **ANY** of these occur:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p15" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p15.1" class="ltx_p">1. **Final Satisfaction**: The user is satisfied with the final document and has no further revisions.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.16.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p16" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p16.1" class="ltx_p">2. **Unproductive Conversation**: The conversation is no longer productive (e.g., going in circles, not addressing the user’s needs, or the assistant’s messages are unhelpful).</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.17" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.17.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.18" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.18.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p18" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p18.1" class="ltx_p">## Output Format</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.19" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.19.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p19.1" class="ltx_p">```json</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
