<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p20.1" class="ltx_p">{{</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p21.1" class="ltx_p">"Analysis": [</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p22" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p22.1" class="ltx_p">"Turn 1: [Brief analysis of user’s requests/feedback]",</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.23" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.23.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p23" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p23.1" class="ltx_p">"Turn 2: [Brief analysis of user’s requests/feedback]",</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.24" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p24" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p24.1" class="ltx_p">…</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.25" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.25.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p25" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p25.1" class="ltx_p">],</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.26" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.26.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p26.1" class="ltx_p">"Ending Turn Number": X,</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.27" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.27.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p27" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p27.1" class="ltx_p">"Termination Reason": "[One of the two criteria above]"</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.28" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.28.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p28" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p28.1" class="ltx_p">}}</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.29" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.29.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p29" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p29.1" class="ltx_p">```</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.30" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.30.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.31" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.31.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.31.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p31" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p31.1" class="ltx_p">## Notes:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.32.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p32" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p32.1" class="ltx_p">1. The "Ending Turn Number" should be the last turn that is relevant to achieving a finalized, satisfactory document.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F58.pic1.2.33.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p33" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F58.pic1.p33.1" class="ltx_p">2. End the conversation if the user explicitly indicates no further changes are needed (Criterion 1) or if it becomes clear that no productive progress is happening (Criterion 2).</span>
</span></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
