<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.14.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p14" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p14.1" class="ltx_p">The tutor’s explanations are unclear, disorganized, or incorrect, making it difficult for the student to follow the reasoning. The session fails to address the student’s learning needs and may even increase confusion.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.15.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
