<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p17" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p17.1" class="ltx_p">The tutor provides minimal assistance, with explanations that are either superficial, incomplete, or contain errors. The student struggles to make progress on the problem, and the tutor does not effectively address their difficulties.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
