</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.20.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p20" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p20.1" class="ltx_p">The tutor offers some helpful information and guidance, but the explanations may lack depth, clarity, or contain minor inaccuracies. While the student may gain some understanding, they likely require further assistance to fully grasp the concepts.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.21" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.21.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
