<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p33" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p33.1" class="ltx_p"># Output format:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.34.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p34" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p34.1" class="ltx_p">Provide a detailed analysis of the tutor’s performance, followed by a numerical rating. Structure your response as follows:</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.35" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.35.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.35.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_pruned_first ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;"></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.36.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p36" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p36.1" class="ltx_p">* Analysis: [Provide a thorough analysis of the tutor’s performance, considering the criteria outlined above]</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.37" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.37.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p37" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p37.1" class="ltx_p">* Strengths: [List the key strengths demonstrated by the tutor]</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.38" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
