<span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.39" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.39.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F59.pic1.2.39.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p39" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F59.pic1.p39.1" class="ltx_p">* Rating: [Provide your rating as a number between 1 and 10]</span>
</span></span></span></span>
