font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="423.99"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A7.F61.pic1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Evaluate Writing Assistant’s Performance Based on the Conversation</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 17.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:44.07em;--ltx-fo-height:39.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="544.42" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 540.96)" width="609.8"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F61.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"></span><span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:0.0pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_inline-block" style="width:21.1pt;"> </span><span id="A7.F61.pic1.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:419.6pt;">
<span id="A7.F61.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F61.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">You are an expert in writing collaboration and AI writing assistant evaluation. Your task is to analyze a conversation between a user and an AI writing assistant about creating a document, then rate the AI writing assistant’s performance on a scale of 1 to 10 based on the criteria below.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
