<span id="A7.F63.pic1.p21" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A7.F63.pic1.p21.1" class="ltx_p">1. **Analysis of Conversation 1**</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F63.pic1.2.22" class="ltx_p" style="width:440.7pt;"><span id="A7.F63.pic1.2.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:440.7pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A7.F63.pic1.2.22.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:440.7pt;">
