</figure>
<figure id="A7.F68" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/math_tutoring_step_1_1.png" id="A7.F68.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/266;" width="476" height="266" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 68: </span>Continued step 1, with questions asking user’s understanding of the problem and math expertise.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F69" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/math_tutoring_step_2.png" id="A7.F69.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/275;" width="476" height="275" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 69: </span>Step 2 of the math tutoring annotation interface: converse with the AI tutor.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F70" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/math_tutoring_step_2_1.png" id="A7.F70.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/274;" width="476" height="274" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 70: </span>Continued step 2, annotating the tutor’s performance.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F71" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/math_tutoring_step_3.png" id="A7.F71.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/272;" width="476" height="272" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 71: </span>Step 3 of the math tutoring annotation interface: if the user feels that they solve the problem, they move onto the second problem that has similar concepts.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F72" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/math_tutoring_step_3_1.png" id="A7.F72.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/274;" width="476" height="274" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 72: </span>Continued step 3, the user can optionally to give annotation to tutor’s performance on the second problem.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F73" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/document_creation_step_1.png" id="A7.F73.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/275;" width="476" height="275" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 73: </span>Step 1 of the document creation annotation interface: selecting interested document intent or work on their own intent.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F74" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/document_creation_step_2.png" id="A7.F74.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/274;" width="476" height="274" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 74: </span>Step 2 of the document creation annotation interface: jot down some thoughts for the document intent the user chooses.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F75" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/document_creation_step_3.png" id="A7.F75.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/276;" width="476" height="276" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 75: </span>Step 3 of the document creation annotation interface: converse with the AI writing assistant.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F76" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2510.05444v1/fig/document_creation_step_3_1.png" id="A7.F76.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/277;" width="476" height="277" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 76: </span>Continued step 3, annotate the performance of the AI writing assistant.</figcaption>
